{"ref":"BDB, מוֹתָר","hw":"מוֹתָר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹתָר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.23\">Pr 14:23</a></sup> <strong>abundance, pre-eminence</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>abundance, plenty</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹתָ֑ר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.23\">Pr 14:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.5\">21:5</a> (in both opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסוֹר</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  2, <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹתַר הָאָדָם מִן־הַבְּהֵמָה אָיִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:19\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.19\">Ec 3:19</a> <em>the superiority of man over beast is nothing</em>.","next":"BDB, מֵיתָר","prev":"BDB, הוֹתִיר²"}